flowchart TD
  Start([User requests password reset]) --> Lookup[Look up account by email]
  Lookup --> Found{Account found?}
  Found -->|No| Neutral[Show neutral confirmation]
  Found -->|Yes| Issue[Issue single-use reset token]
  Issue --> Send[Send reset link]
  Send --> Open[User opens link]
  Open --> Valid{Token valid and unexpired?}
  Valid -->|No| Retry[Offer a new reset request]
  Valid -->|Yes| Update[Save the new password]
  Update --> Revoke[Revoke the reset token]
  Revoke --> Done([Confirm password changed])
